  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T F.747.7 defines the scenarios and the functional requirements for network‑based location information conversion (NBLIC) for different applications and services. The NBLIC system provides the translation capability through specific algorithms, which can present location information in different formats to fit in various scenarios. The system also provides diverse functions and capabilities, such as interoperability, security, and privacy protection to the retrieved location data and to the converted information.</abstract>
